sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 🧑 User
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant Help as 🆘 Helpdesk
    participant Hub as 👥 Cross-Team Hub
    participant Draft as 📧 Message Drafting
    participant Translate as 🌐 Translation

    User->>Gateway: Request help
    Gateway->>Help: Create support ticket
    Help-->>User: Ticket reference

    User->>Gateway: Post to cross-team hub
    Gateway->>Hub: Save discussion thread
    Hub-->>User: Thread visible to peers

    User->>Gateway: Draft client email
    Gateway->>Draft: Generate draft
    Draft-->>User: Suggested draft

    User->>Gateway: Request translation
    Gateway->>Translate: Translate transcript
    Translate-->>User: Localized version
